================================================================================
                          CIPHERBOX PQC CORE
================================================================================

             From-scratch post-quantum cryptography for servers:
             ML-KEM-768 / ML-KEM-1024, X25519 hybrid KEM, secret-
             derived rooms with a forward-secure ratchet, Keccak,
             and chunked large-file encryption.

                          Version 0.7.0  |  MIT License
                          Status: KAT-validated, NOT audited.

